## Authentication
Bearer Token — Authentication method detected from captured traffic.

### Providing credentials
- Prefer passing auth as request headers or cookies at call time (do not hardcode secrets into the skill).
- If executing via an external proxy/executor, pass per-call credentials (cookies and/or headers) so they are not persisted.

## Dependencies
- Runtime capable of HTTPS requests.
- If using `scripts/api.ts`: TypeScript toolchain (or transpile to JS).

## Endpoints

### Auth Flow (3)
- `GET /lookup/{lookupToken}` — Retrieve authentication token using a lookup token.
- `POST /{id}/{token}` — Complete an authentication flow using ID and token.
- `POST /blaize/anonymous-session` — Create an anonymous session in Blaize.

### Data Read (4)
- `GET /api/coral-counts` — Get counts related to Coral (commenting platform).
- `GET /blaize/datalayer` — Read data from the Blaize data layer.
- `GET /dvtag/signals/{signalId}/pub.json` — Retrieve public JSON data for a specific DVTag signal.
- `GET /geo` — Get geographical location data.

### Data Write (4)
- `POST /e/dtb/bid` — Submit a bid to the DTB system.
- `POST /fins/segment` — Send segment data to Fins.
- `POST /metrics/ga/g/c` — Send metrics data to Google Analytics.
- `POST /SendEventData` — Send event data to the server.

### Config (3)
- `GET /cdn/prod/config` — Retrieve CDN production configuration.
- `GET /duet/verge/config.json` — Get Verge's Duet configuration.
- `GET /getconfig/sodar` — Fetch Sodar configuration settings.

